      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DARING BANDIT (2) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at Bendigo over 425m behind Ritza Old Mate (24.48) in a Grade 5. Ready to return to form. HOT SUMMER SKY (3) goes very well this trip starting 22 times for eight wins and six minors. Below best last time at this track (16.99) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4 length fifth. Looks well placed here and among the chances. BE A SHADOW (1) jumped from this box last time and placed in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 at this track over 300m, finishing third (17.12). Has a very consistent record off this same box, including three wins and six placings from 11 starts. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. MISS BOBBIE (8) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
